From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 08:44:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mshtml: batch b1 (element, document, command target, OLE
 object members)

Implements about 210 documented-but-stubbed members:
- IHTMLElement/2/3/6/7 on comment and non-HTML (SVG) elements: className, lang,
  tabIndex, accessKey, contentEditable, spellcheck, offset and client boxes,
  innerHTML (parsed through a range), click (synthesized MouseEvents),
  applyElement, setCapture, componentFromPoint, canHandleChildren, isMultiLine,
  inflateBlock, getAttributeNodeNS/setAttributeNodeNS, ElementSelector on comments.
- IHTMLRect writable edges, rect collection clone/coercion/empty lists,
  filters collection enumerator, attribute collection index coercion.
- New event ids: filterchange, mouseenter, transitionend/start, animationiteration.
- IProvideMultipleClassInfo of elements (class type information).
- Document: empty collections for XML documents, fragments (createDocumentFragment,
  getElementsByName/TagName/ClassName), DocumentType ids, designMode on/off/inherit,
  file size and dates, protocol, security, baseUrl, xml* properties, normalize, body.
- Command target: host forwarding of OLECMDID_OPEN/NEW/SAVE*/PAGESETUP/..., cut,
  paste, undo, redo, delete, enable interaction, close, frame refresh, copy/cut/paste
  state from the editor; editing commands strikethrough, subscript, superscript,
  unlink, removeformat, justifyfull, backcolor, formatblock, undo, redo.
- IOleObject/IOleDocument/IOleInPlaceActiveObject/IOleInPlaceObjectWindowless/
  IObjectWithSite/IOleContainer members and the DocNode delegation.

